  "description": "AspGuard for ASP.NET 4.x (MVC 5, Web API 2, WebForms) on .NET Framework 4.6.2+. Installing it is the whole setup: it registers an HTTP module that adds security headers, HSTS, CSRF protection and per-IP rate limiting, makes every request an N+1 detection scope, and ships the Roslyn analyzers with code fixes (queries in loops, raw SQL injection, generated XML documentation). Add AspGuard.EntityFramework6 for EF6 query detection.",
